-- =============================================================================
-- V126: Portal service-history fixtures for WO-172 integration tests.
-- =============================================================================
-- Creates 65 work orders for ACCT_A (portal user A) across two sites, plus
-- 5 work orders for ACCT_B to prove account isolation. Mix of all 8 lifecycle
-- states, deliberately sharing created_at values to exercise UUID tie-breaking.
--
-- UUID prefix: d0000000-... (65 ACCT_A rows), d1000000-... (5 ACCT_B rows)
--
-- Sites used:
--   site_a1 = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001  (ACCT_A)
--   site_a2 = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002  (ACCT_A)
--   site_b1 = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003  (ACCT_B)
--
-- ACCT_A rows:
--   d00...001 – d00...020 : site_a1, state NEW   (all same created_at → UUID tie-break)
--   d00...021 – d00...030 : site_a1, state ASSIGNED
--   d00...031 – d00...040 : site_a1, state COMPLETED
--   d00...041 – d00...045 : site_a2, state CLOSED
--   d00...046 – d00...050 : site_a2, state CANCELLED
--   d00...051 – d00...055 : site_a2, state ON_HOLD
--   d00...056 – d00...060 : site_a1, state EN_ROUTE
--   d00...061 – d00...065 : site_a1, state IN_PROGRESS
--
-- ACCT_B rows:
--   d10...001 – d10...005 : site_b1, state NEW
-- =============================================================================

